# Git & IDE
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
**/.DS_Store

# Dependencies & caches
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.task

# .NET build artifacts
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/TestResults

# Env & secrets — never bake into images
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*credentials*
**/*secret*

# Docs, tests, local tooling (not needed in runtime images)
docs
scripts
**/README.md
**/*.md
ctx.include
mprocs-dev.yaml
dotnet-tools.json

# API tests (not needed for publish)
apps/lazuar-api/tests

# Large lock-adjacent / unused for single-app builds can still stay for monorepo
**/.cache
**/coverage
